{"job_id":"F-fd472c9604d8b19c38bc","family_id":"F-fd472c9604d8b19c38bc","title":"공항에서의 귀빈 예우에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":18,"target_id":"cb988c0cf7c25971b9f88c261b9c9e7f43871e820c38c2499701501ff5c77894","source_hash":"312bdfe102f4b7230d9fc421af57ccf86878e82478e449bcb7ac1c3f47c9c313","text":"机场贵宾待遇规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":117,"target_id":"f91f765da3e98a853e6e04f1d8f3112fac7abf931200e27e90cbfbb98bba59d0","source_hash":"af7665c343b1cf78cd60f9d2e43ff1b592caee6283a1b0a327429468847b9bdc","text":"第一条（目的）本规则旨在规定根据《机场设施法》第二条第三款在机场设立贵宾室的必要事项、贵宾出入境手续的委托办理以及委托人进入入境检查区域的相关事宜。<2017年3月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":117,"end":265,"target_id":"518c4b98a5d9e48be9ade2292af3e50939d76ff5ae8155415423d67bda77bc18","source_hash":"34422e8c917c9bed5ca0443420ed6eaea79d7fadc66aaaa294fcd6f442dc7fad","text":"第二条（适用范围） 除其他法律法规另有规定外，机场贵宾室的运营、出入境手续的代理以及代理人根据《机场设施法》第二条第三款进入机场出入境检查区域的活动，适用本规则的规定。<2017年3月30日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":265,"end":599,"target_id":"1ea9bf3dad2c2903c66a8cef6c3676dd54997e82e9c3aa86c40044eda2caeada","source_hash":"58ce873a8016451d1c69b8d350404d7e4531ae7c0b6c908219db73bcf81e9b95","text":"第三条（定义）本规则中使用的术语含义如下。\n1。“贵宾室”是指机场航站楼内专门安装的场所，用于向根据本规则指定的贵宾在出入境时提供礼遇。\n2.“移民手续办理机构”是指代表贵宾办理出入境手续。\n3。“移民和海关代理人”是指经机场礼宾官员或贵宾授权，代表他们执行移民和海关程序的人员。\n4. “入境检查区”是指根据有关法律法规的规定，在国际飞机抵达或出发的机场专门设立的入境检查区、保税区、检疫区等，用于执行入境管制、海关清关、检疫等职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":599,"end":1175,"target_id":"3669f58e403a04af92db486ef3f63fdf9d419e17e951cd2f8920bb8131b34464","source_hash":"306d0b50a78114f2bf60f4ce8b279f69cdd3734b152a30d256b55bbc93a06244","text":"第四条（贵宾室使用资格）\n① 获准使用贵宾室的人员如下。<2013年3月23日、2015年10月16日、2016年9月26日修订>\n1. 总统和前总统\n2. 国民议会议长、最高法院首席大法官、宪法法院院长、总理、国家选举委员会主席、前国民议会议长、前最高法院首席大法官、前宪法法院院长、前总理和前国家选举委员会主席\n3. 国民议会中拥有议会谈判小组的政党代表\n4. 外交部长认为有必要建议给予特殊礼遇的符合下列任何一项条件的人士\na. 驻韩国外交使团团长\nB. 国际组织代表\n. 受第1至3款规定的外国公民\nd. 外交部长或其他部长级或以上级别的外国人\n5. 任何其他履行与公务相关的日程安排，并经仁川国际机场公社社长（以下简称“仁川国际机场公社社长”）根据《仁川国际机场公社法》第2条或韩国机场公社社长（以下简称“韩国机场公社社长”）根据《韩国机场公社法》第2条认可的人员。\n② 根据第 1 款有资格使用贵宾室的人的配偶和子女可以与贵宾一起使用贵宾室。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1175,"end":1459,"target_id":"7f308bce7f3fe0de0ebb8e9acbdff75ef1326949255b79b0d790b6af9dfb28b5","source_hash":"5bb2745a8424e0c7c415cbc58e38e8df52c4a657638ccc84c05d035b7de3859a","text":"第五条（贵宾室使用程序）\n① 任何拟使用贵宾室的人员（外国人指邀请人或办理出入境手续的代理人；以下统称“邀请人”）应在使用贵宾室前24小时向仁川国际机场公社社长（仁川国际机场）或韩国机场公社社长（其他机场）提出申请。<2016年9月26日修订>\n② 仁川国际机场公社社长或韩国机场公社社长收到根据第1款提出的使用贵宾室的申请后，应当分配贵宾室，并将此事通知申请人和负责出入境检查工作的机构负责人，例如海关负责人。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1459,"end":1618,"target_id":"4b2ad44235e3578158087debdb9ef2fecea36e2ce25cc8f14142b1f42dd8b7cf","source_hash":"052a008051ab736699f624bc563e93816518ebc03072ce4be2d04d1fe2a80b58","text":"第六条（贵宾室准入限制）\n① 仁川国际机场公社社长或韩国机场公社社长可以限制送客或迎客人员进入贵宾室，以维持贵宾室的秩序。\n②仁川国际机场公社社长或韩国机场公社社长可采取必要措施，例如部署保安人员，限制贵宾室的进入。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1618,"end":1779,"target_id":"45dff82a0656c40c5c3eb636ea52220be146db42603d0f89ffda2e7cd935e4f8","source_hash":"01c49fcbdc1b8472a1eb0ae196d6a5606153b4f7f85fa65240e8ca2e006fc78d","text":"第七条（移民程序机构）\n① VIP房间的使用者可以委托移民代理人代为办理移民手续。但是，符合第四条第一款第五项规定的VIP房间使用者及其配偶和子女不受此限制。<2011年8月2日修订；2016年9月26日修订>\n② 删除 <1986.12.31>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1779,"end":1897,"target_id":"66b9a5307b00f6963227722367468d2675a4a1f2545b6b24163ada18b83a8d92","source_hash":"ecf6b9d15e26c4f254ced9a5e565df9673c31ccec98a7398ae1628c52f37887b","text":"第八条（贵宾出入境）贵宾房使用者可以免检出境。但第四条第一款第五项规定有资格使用贵宾房的人员及其配偶和子女除外。<2016年9月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1897,"end":2096,"target_id":"4f2f991aaeee6ce1b39e188113a75eea93d2385f28e640b9376dd019235a7f26","source_hash":"e2282f0d8e4a2a1faf4f05c92a92d46bb14be9fccbbd031d75a855aba9781b71","text":"第九条（禁止进入入境检查区）\n① 除贵宾室使用者及其代表外，任何人不得进入入境检查区域。但入境检查区域正在举行仪式活动时，此规定不适用。\n② 地区航空管理局局长应向办理出入境手续的代理人签发临时入境许可，允许其进入出入境检查区和保税区。在这种情况下，需要事先与出入境管理处处长和海关负责人协商。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2096,"end":2287,"target_id":"f9a38481c5d160c0428cfebdef7a458ad8c336efc83093220a091da7b0376ad8","source_hash":"daa4681edd8039baec2029b76afc3b797a2021ab40861b5dbdc132bcb1410d24","text":"第九条第二款（贵宾室新闻发布会）\n① 各部委（包括与其同等机构的负责人）可向仁川国际机场公社社长或韩国机场公社社长申请在贵宾休息室举行新闻发布会。\n② 仁川国际机场公社社长或韩国机场公社社长根据第1款批准在贵宾室举行新闻发布会时，应当将该事实通知申请人。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2287,"end":2308,"target_id":"e66671973118d3e2b19502171827801d573d0f8339520abf8980ae2a41d8ef84","source_hash":"6652d6131f61163c3fa78bf9ff23d18753ff605249a453fc10d77f99f052390e","text":"文章 10 已删除 <1993.7.26>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2308,"end":2434,"target_id":"0b64a9b687ddfd378e84580bcc5870b5f30119abf2b18423eff97f50c9571e15","source_hash":"410065795b941948811c4a8b72002f7554d4d73ae4547d991ee0df9a4703d174","text":"第11条（制定详细实施细则的咨询）  除本规则另有规定外，在确定有关贵宾室使用和进入入境检查区域的具体事项时，仁川国际机场公社社长或韩国机场公社社长应当事先与海关等相关部门负责人进行磋商。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2434,"end":2478,"target_id":"81cae7aea6e21480c2bb0538a81bd74530c9051ba9b5d37c031d6fc90d15b7ee","source_hash":"54252ec510cf0f221f3333c5e02eb6c1ebbc5fbc91b703fabd6516a5f1bbdd40","text":"补充规定 <1983年6月4日第1573号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2478,"end":2522,"target_id":"f4e62079e860ad13f56a0146fb0cc16d8b5569ef1df4358823cd20a3f1d41496","source_hash":"c53b50959653a45a1c9ff71042fb356080213ada262e412f68d00ba4d05b7a77","text":"补充规定 <第1624号，1984年9月7日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2522,"end":2573,"target_id":"7f744b55904b2f4c35cbc458c1b2c31d933248d43dbbb8a7549da85dee2a7b6f","source_hash":"884bad08439300e0ff59ae81884e04cfb61c5ba342ad10d9aac4c7bf88703cb1","text":"补充规定 <第1697号，1986年12月31日>\n\n本规则自1987年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2573,"end":2618,"target_id":"f83efa08f7e47b7dcfa810cf67c1ab40b9d4a47c5d1eab337ced456d1afeb0ed","source_hash":"aa2004a78da2ca091165e82ffde86eefc16e20a2acd2fddc030df59bd8597ae7","text":"补充规定 <第1836号，1990年11月29日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2618,"end":2663,"target_id":"1d1319a9423d0ace08669827fad8a6860ef8b7bfd35eeccad64e3a5e8641ed76","source_hash":"4325ab34d1f08f45dc0a008626513b1644718f06bcea5f99d1f9aa4beaee1fd8","text":"补充规定 <第1941号，1993年7月26日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2663,"end":2788,"target_id":"97b293d0cde36e51b4ed7dc84fedbf3a0fb7b716b08508310a712c1b3f597883","source_hash":"ee6b7786bc040c5b2a930c56743106c29d386f6ea7148f4bea54ae629789e268","text":"补充规定 <274号，2001年3月29日>\n\n①（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（适用于推荐外国贵宾）第4条第1款第6项的修订规定适用于本规则实施后外交贸易部长首次推荐的人员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2788,"end":2832,"target_id":"c48b2814bf1ac42d24f68d5b7cc1def878f7823147489cac79ad713497e482d6","source_hash":"7bb6adc3c6cdad6c6b397c6d05b742a7a573453ab43129783b11d87800a58531","text":"补充规定 <第303号，2001年11月27日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2832,"end":2875,"target_id":"2a20b26421047bd14670b1a81241e18a74e3ffcf643aacfe4638b7c3b75fda4e","source_hash":"fcac0de60b6e9773988cf876ac598265a93d7b06abaf5404e33c4ccc5b2630ab","text":"补充规定 <第221号，2011年7月12日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2875,"end":2917,"target_id":"00ba01927dc347fc0df3b64be26b95c832beaa1e3d42f2fb06b3d44f8c06b7cb","source_hash":"582f25b609c70c4438a71abe59b77b15db9274596b23112400d338b8cf93ad69","text":"补充规定 <228号，2011年8月2日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2917,"end":2960,"target_id":"8f521ac85ce6b7d42f67f2c46b129b6ab2c1f1e4d5a30fc3568a7f1f7ec8a0fc","source_hash":"7c33c11982e160726c809b32fc011fe318cadacaff7ccd55f5ca542dee82c415","text":"补充规定（国土交通部及其下属机构组织结构实施细则）<2013年3月23日第1号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2960,"end":2998,"target_id":"64d69d1a92ff217c6f94ceb1e80f7a50c84ed354351af9e0c1b2bb70c0b02538","source_hash":"17f62718ec8681372d471c3803ff3647ee41b5c21c983badb3168350a437f2a5","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2998,"end":3015,"target_id":"1fd0a0faa9bce58a29586e30d33c7a6b67c4b61636a871dfaa0008c0f16b67c6","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3015,"end":3159,"target_id":"1decd05ea34f57163f070fc8ae87f4631f9c7739987e8983f450d39938a4db46","source_hash":"1f1b22aebfd460febc57a8ae006ba7a39c82e750f781dd81959572116d5bf1d0","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<26>款省略\n\n  <27> 机场贵宾礼遇规则部分修订如下。\n\n  除第 4 条第 1 款第 4 项所列项目外，“外交和贸易部长”应改为“外交部长”。\n\n  <28> 至 <126> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3159,"end":3203,"target_id":"eaf5385c24f3694626dd280c94138b4dde9a60becdd3faa72225c92fd85c312a","source_hash":"d12fe8270d03e3e0346aa74f7fed27dc0c772045bb0a50b075583bdd50a756ac","text":"补充规定 <239号，2015年10月16日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3203,"end":3246,"target_id":"33633bd09b72ec118e628e50e91bf18dc59c88fd565d2807f87cc0d241f03bce","source_hash":"3d5114fbd2d430b93385b7bd605c0fd6f9f53b301aa5fe16276ac5daebb65b0b","text":"补充规定 <第365号，2016年9月26日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3246,"end":3280,"target_id":"6ce08b867d883b3c18cdec12eb5b4185ca384585acde1a94358954ee0a7c7de4","source_hash":"3c1eae1f4c42462688dc15e7f1822d41e28e8b784969c6a44c2bea867cd296a2","text":"增补（机场设施法实施细则）<第414号，2017年3月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3280,"end":3317,"target_id":"a30c42dc3b99a6e664380ddcfa3c3d0165452661eceac13efe609ccdd496efeb","source_hash":"f62570f7da3fe62a61fe6417a3f701b8b195b36bb869cf7de5f05342d6aeb093","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2017年3月30日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3317,"end":3331,"target_id":"3ba3d56a5c261642c7edaa38688cda3f1f527f0b9f435ecd79b250145908fae2","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"省略第 2 条和第 3 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3331,"end":3393,"target_id":"4282bfb052726805128b5970784fcb4eacb3203b6ae752df2a3b87a8241c75e9","source_hash":"1e5ec87d722d70b68c9d07515c77639c43e670922a4702ed5cd8d2f5221f3c18","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）① 省略\n\n  ② 《机场贵宾待遇规则》部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3393,"end":3463,"target_id":"2e1a04b5f18fdce6f4348dcdf4932f46b4e227282714dfe64110d5e78b7b1efc","source_hash":"59d7f0eb8aa9909b8d45f0e48765f6ce5ebd42fd7aa030ee16710ab75939c07f","text":"  第 1 条和第 2 条中的“航空法第 2 条第 7 款”应分别改为“机场设施法第 2 条第 3 款”。\n\n  跳过 ③ 到 ⑦\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006774-193067-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3463,"end":3469,"target_id":"2499e48b0ef6090a001e43c6f26e53e71fc0ef9eda1d845a7a365156ca3c8865","source_hash":"52aefd19ad92afb7e0440de9711a2a890e97fd145879356b7b04cc07d2ca9c9a","text":"第5条省略"}]}